<title>USA: 3-D Systems says board oks stock buyback.</title>
<headline>3-D Systems says board oks stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>VALENCIA, Calif 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>3D Systems Corp said its board of directors has authorized the company to buy up to 1.5 million of its shares in the open market and through private transactions.</p>
<p>The company has about 11.8 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
